  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chopped parsley and rosemary to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Thread a kabanos sausage onto each wooden skewer.",
    "Brush the sausages with the herbal mixture.",
    "Grill the skewers for 5 minutes per side, or until the sausages are cooked through.",
    "Let the skewers rest for 2 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve the skewers hot, garnished with additional parsley and rosemary if desired."
